name: sim.getQHull
description: Deprecated. Use the simConvex API instead
luaSynopsis: list verticesOut, list indicesOut = sim.getQHull(list verticesIn)
pythonSynopsis: float[] verticesOut, int[] indicesOut = sim.getQHull(float[] verticesIn)
inputs:
1. verticesIn: array containing the input vertices (succession of [x y z] values)
outputs:
1. verticesOut: array containing the output vertices (succession of [x y z] values)
2. indicesOut: array containing the output indices (3 values for each triangle)
